      "TLS, HTTP redirects, terminal rendering of response bodies, or following the 301 that 1.1.1.1 returns on port 80.";
      "Rewriting http-get in another language or widening the C component runtime ABI.";
      "Physical NIC, IOMMU or board qualification. QEMU evidence carries no hardware claim.";
      "Consuming the entropy service from the network service, http-get or sel4-net; that migration is separate work.";
      "D3's deterministic-component sealing rule, recording drawn entropy in a replay trace, and entropy for the host build service.";
